      "content": "GREAT GADDESDEN        GADDESDEN ROW TL 01 SW                                         (South side)                                         Jockey End 3/90                                    Stable at Brown's                                         Orchard 6m to NE of                                         house GV                                      II Stable. Circa 1600. Timber frame, dark weatherboarded with steep old red tile roof. A 4-bays stable, beside gate, extending along N boundary, facing S.  Straight braces to wallplates.  Curved braces to cambered tie-beams. Intermediate trusses with inclined queen-posts, end trusses with collar and queen-strut. Clasped-purlin roof with curved wind-braces. Listing NGR: TL0409213659"
    }
